NetBird
  The add-on downloads NetBird's client at run time from NetBird's own GitHub
  releases (https://github.com/netbirdio/netbird). It is not part of this
  repository or its releases. NetBird's client is BSD-3-Clause licensed; its
  licenses come with the download and are kept beside the client on the device
  (/data/techo5-netbird/client/LICENSE, LICENSES/).

TECHO5
  Parts are adapted from TECHO5 (https://github.com/HuskerMinion/techo5),
  MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 TECHO5 contributors: how its built-in NetBird
  ran the client (daemon.go, client.go, the profile edit in profile.go), its
  host name rules (device.go) and firewall check (device.go), and the routes
  from the mesh of HuskerMinion/techo5#603 (routes.go).

